`include_router` adds the router's prefix to every path operation it registers, so `/items/1` becomes `"/items/items/1"` and the router can't find it. Use `APIRouter(prefix=...)` instead.

```python
from fastapi import APIRouter

items_router = APIRouter(prefix="/items", tags=["items"])

@items_router.get("/{item_id}")
def read_item(item_id: int):
    return {"id": item_id}

app.include_router(items_router)
```

